{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 37, "model_name": "mistralai/mixtral-8x7b-instruct-v0.1", "content": " Upon the land of the rising sun I doth set forth,\n\nTo experience the wonders of Japan in a fortnight's worth.\n\nDay one, I alight at Narita, with bags in hand,\nIn the bustling city of Tokyo I make my first stand.\n\nThe Senso-ji shrine, a place of peace and rest,\nShall be my first stop, to pay homage and the like.\n\nThen, to the Shibuya Crossing, a sight to behold,\nWhere hundreds of souls converge, a story to be told.\n\nDay two, I shall venture to the Meiji Shrine,\nTo give thanks and praise to the deities divine.\n\nNext, to the Shinjuku Gyoen, for a stroll in the park,\nWhere beauty and nature, forever make their mark.\n\nDay three, I sail to the man-made island of Odaiba,\nThe Miraikan and teamLab Borderless, art and science in a spree.\n\nThe day four, I take a train to the city of Nikko,\nTo see the Toshogu Shrine, a page from history I seek.\n\nOn the fifth day, I venture to the city of Hakone,\nTo behold the majesty of Mount Fuji, my breath is taken.\n\nDay six, I take the shinkansen, to the city of Kyoto,\nThe Kinkaku-ji temple, a golden treasure trove I seek.\n\nOn the seventh day, I visit the Fushimi Inari Shrine,\nTorii gates lining the path, a truly divine sign.\n\nDay eight, I travel to the city of Nara,\nThe Todai-ji temple, a Buddha so grand and awe-inspiring.\n\nOn the ninth day, I return to Kyoto,\nThe Arashiyama Bamboo Grove, a natural beauty I'm eager to see.\n\nDay ten, I visit the city of Hiroshima,\nTo pay tribute to the past, a memory preserved in amber.\n\nOn the eleventh day, I sail to the island of Miyajima,\nThe Itsukushima Shrine, a view to remember.\n\nDay twelve, I return to Kyoto,\nThe Nijo Castle, a fortress so resplendent and regal.\n\nOn the thirteenth day, I venture to the city of Osaka,\nThe Osaka Castle, a symbol of power and might.\n\nAnd on the final day, I return to Tokyo,\nTo savor the memories of this journey, a tale of joy and woe.\n\nSo, let the adventure begin, to Japan I shall go,\nA pilgrimage of discovery, a new chapter to unfold.", "logprobs": [{"token": "Upon", "logprob": -0.16018113493919373}, {"token": "the", "logprob": -0.013940464705228806}, {"token": "land", "logprob": -2.195058584213257}, {"token": "of", "logprob": -2.3841855067985307e-07}, {"token": "the", "logprob": -0.10954280942678452}, {"token": "rising", "logprob": -0.009784122928977013}, {"token": "sun", "logprob": -2.753696753643453e-05}, {"token": "I", "logprob": -0.6998848915100098}, {"token": "d", "logprob": -0.16746701300144196}, {"token": "oth", "logprob": -3.2186455882765586e-06}, {"token": "set", "logprob": -0.09350493550300598}, {"token": "forth", "logprob": -0.4447868764400482}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.00866274069994688}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.0007265550084412098}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.676601231098175}, {"token": "To", "logprob": -0.7349753379821777}, {"token": "experience", "logprob": -2.1097817420959473}, {"token": "the", "logprob": -0.577373206615448}, {"token": "w", "logprob": -0.03959004208445549}, {"token": "onders", "logprob": -7.486063259420916e-05}, {"token": "of", "logprob": -0.2646229863166809}, {"token": "Japan", "logprob": -0.07807186990976334}, {"token": "in", "logprob": -0.6224297285079956}, {"token": "a", "logprob": -2.1913633346557617}, {"token": "fort", "logprob": -0.16950096189975739}, {"token": "night", "logprob": -6.603976362384856e-05}, {"token": "'", "logprob": -1.0847986231965479e-05}, {"token": "s", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "worth", "logprob": -2.19277024269104}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.011664992198348045}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -8.4638240878121e-06}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.0011654258705675602}, {"token": "Day", "logprob": -0.8379452228546143}, {"token": "one", "logprob": -1.138260841369629}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.40120774507522583}, {"token": "I", "logprob": -0.30777400732040405}, {"token": "al", "l